# Happy Birthday, Luci! 🎂🐧✨

A custom, mobile-first interactive birthday web application created for my birthday twin, **Luci**. Built using HTML5, CSS3, and Vanilla JavaScript with interactive animations, music playback, media lightbox gallery, and a confetti grand finale.

---

## 🌟 Features

- **Interactive Night Sky & Penguin Guide**: Custom CSS/Canvas ambient background with an interactive SVG penguin guide.
- **Twin Quiz & Adventure**: Playful interactive Q&A section with cute speech bubbles.
- **Custom Music Player**: Integrated audio player supporting custom songs and recordings with a real-time visualizer canvas.
- **Memories Gallery**: Responsive photo and video grid with a full-screen Lightbox viewer.
- **Cinematic Final Surprise**: Unboxing animation with a custom birthday letter and canvas confetti explosion.
- **Mobile-First & Offline Ready**: Optimized for Android Chrome and iOS Safari without external frameworks or backend dependencies.

